:00:00Z","start_ts":1795276800,"stop_ts":1795280400,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"tv52560":{"show_id":"tv52560","tmdb_id":52560,"content_type":"series","title":"ليالي الحلمية","title_en":"El Helmeya Nights","title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يدخل علي سليم البدري منافسًا انتخابيًا أمام زاهر سليمان غانم، ولا يؤثر زواج علي من زُهرة في تقليل هذا الصراع بل يزيده سوءًا بعد أن اعتبرها مسئولة عن وفاة زوجته الأولى شيرين. يتزوج عادل البدري من فلسطينية بعد انفصاله عن قمر السماحي ويدير مصنع البدري بعد أن عاد للوجود. بينما يدير قهوة السماحي المعلم سيد أبوليلة (يوسف شعبان) بادئًا عهدًا جديدًا بما تمثله قهوة السماحي من رمزٍ لمصر.","description_en":"A sweeping saga spanning Egyptian history from the era of King Farouk to the early 21st century, Al Helmeya Nights centres on the bitter rivalry between the Al-Badri and Ghanem families in Cairo's Helmeya neighbourhood. Driven by revenge, ambition, and shifting power, the series — written by Osama Anwar Okasha with over 300 actors across six seasons — is widely considered one of the greatest achievements in Arab television drama.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b192ygPjNQxd1ND24WxgXpSNury.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWbZ8VAckvLDsyokfbMXszkYI3o.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1987","release_date":"1987-10-18","runtime_minutes":40,"status":"Ended","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv247718","tv71712","tv5920","tv259909","tv56570","tv76773","tv2288","tv4607"],"director":"أسامة أنور عكاشة","cast":[{"name":"يحيى الفخراني","character":"Selim El-Badry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lzQT2AX0yDTe63eYMjFuTIUGf4X.jpg"},{"name":"صفية العمري","character":"Nazik El-Selehdar","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rrixVov0m0g6M0l4lCOD3XnacPv.jpg"},{"name":"هشام سليم","character":"Adel Selim El-Badry","profile_image":"https://image.t